#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/ledfancontrol/backend.js:280
msgid "Automatic (thermal curve)"
msgstr "自动（温度曲线）"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/ledfancontrol/backend.js:327
msgid "Curve start temperature"
msgstr "曲线起始温度"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/ledfancontrol/backend.js:328
msgid "At or below this temperature the fan runs at the minimum speed."
msgstr "温度达到或低于此值时，风扇以最低转速运行。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/ledfancontrol/backend.js:333
msgid "Curve full-speed temperature"
msgstr "曲线满速温度"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/ledfancontrol/backend.js:334
msgid ""
"At this temperature the fan reaches full speed, and stays there above it."
msgstr "温度达到此值时风扇升至满速，高于此值则保持满速。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/ledfancontrol/backend.js:339
msgid "Emergency temperature"
msgstr "应急温度"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/ledfancontrol/backend.js:340
msgid ""
"At or above this temperature the fan is forced to full speed regardless of "
"the curve."
msgstr "温度达到或高于此值时，无论曲线如何，风扇强制满速。"

