#: root/usr/share/luci/menu.d/luci-app-ledfancontrol.json:3
msgid "Led&fan Control"
msgstr "灯光与风扇"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ledfancontrol.js:174
#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"This device has a \"%s\" backend, but this version of the page has no "
"support for it."
msgstr "本设备有一个“%s”后端，但此版本的页面不支持它。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ledfancontrol.js:175
msgid "No supported LED and fan backend was found on this device."
msgstr "未在本设备上找到受支持的灯光与风扇后端。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ledfancontrol.js:177
msgid ""
"The backend is installed and running; it is only this configuration page "
"that is out of date."
msgstr "后端已安装并正在运行，只是这个配置页面版本过旧。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ledfancontrol.js:178
msgid ""
"This page drives the lighting and the fan either through a vendor daemon or "
"through the kernel's own LED, hwmon and thermal interfaces. Neither was "
"found here."
msgstr ""
"本页通过厂商守护进程、或通过内核自身的 LED、hwmon 与 thermal 接口来驱动灯光与"
"风扇。本机两者都没有找到。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ledfancontrol.js:206
msgid ""
"Unified control of the RGB PWM lighting and of the fan thermal control. A "
"change takes effect as soon as it is saved and applied."
msgstr "统一控制 RGB PWM 灯光与风扇温控。保存并应用后立即生效。"

